<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00419/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">项目描述</span>：</strong>一副由<span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司</span>生产的<span style="font-size:x-large;">███眼镜</span>，会使<span style="font-size:x-large;">佩戴者</span>认为其所看到的<span style="font-size:x-large;">文字</span>中的<span style="font-size:x-large;">名词部分</span>比<span style="font-size:x-large;">其他部分</span>要大一些。<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">日期</span>：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收<span style="font-size:x-large;">地点</span>：</strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">████公司专卖店</span>。<br />
<strong>当前<span style="font-size:x-large;">状态</span>：</strong>存放于Dr.K的<span style="font-size:x-large;">办公室</span>内。<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:x-large;">笔记</span>：</strong><em>确实是大<strong>亿</strong>些。&#8212;Dr.K</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00419" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00419" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00419-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607934100" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601610342 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 Oct 2020 03:45</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00433/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台松下████型烤箱，会在启动后把其内部的有机物随机转化为碳元素的其中一种表现形式。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>实习研究员宫三的住处<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于Site-CN-39员工厨房<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“我等了一个小时的火鸡变成焦煤了啊啊啊啊啊——”——Dr.Gaster，于圣诞节</em><br />
<em>“好&#8230;&#8230;好大一盆钻石&#8230;&#8230;”——尝试使用该项目烤制戚风蛋糕的实习研究员宫三</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00433" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00433" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00433-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tao-wu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6351300); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6351300&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607934100" alt="Tao_Wu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6351300)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tao-wu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6351300); return false;">Tao_Wu</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602060602 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">07 Oct 2020 08:50</span></p>
